    "tiptap_body": {
      "body": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Okay circling back after testing. It’s works and I love it! ",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Okay circling back after testing. It’s works and I love it! "
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
              },
              {
                "text": "I also made sure to give full access to my Google Drive. ",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "I also made sure to give full access to my Google Drive. "
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
              },
              {
                "text": "Now, before Claude creates an artifact in this project, it will run the naming convention prompt, searching all other artifacts in the project AND in my Google Drive, and let me know what it finds, offering to show them to me in that chat. (That way I can edit what exists or synthesis what I am building with what’s been built already.), and lastly,updates version history across each document.",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Now, before Claude creates an artifact in this project, it will run the naming convention prompt, searching all other artifacts in the project AND in my Google Drive, and let me know what it finds, offering to show them to me in that chat. (That way I can edit what exists or synthesis what I am building with what’s been built already.), and lastly,updates version history across each document."
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "hardBreak",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "\n"
              },
              {
                "text": "Big win!!",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Big win!!"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Okay circling back after testing. It’s works and I love it! \n\nI also made sure to give full access to my Google Drive. \n\nNow, before Claude creates an artifact in this project, it will run the naming convention prompt, searching all other artifacts in the project AND in my Google Drive, and let me know what it finds, offering to show them to me in that chat. (That way I can edit what exists or synthesis what I am building with what’s been built already.), and lastly,updates version history across each document.\n\nBig win!!",
